    "caption": "🎬 You are invited to a LIVE session on Telegram with a participant of Silkway Accelerator from Azerbaijan!\n\nToghrul Samad, the founder of Voiceloft, will discuss the creation of highly accurate speech recognition models for 110 languages, which are 10 times faster and cheaper. He will also share his experience participating in the Silkway Accelerator program.\n\nVoiceloft is a technology that can understand people from all around the world, offering businesses a more accessible engine to better connect with their customers, regardless of demographic, pitch, dialect, speech modes, or semantics.\n\nJoin us today at 5 p.m. \n\nTelegram: astana_hub\n\n#live_hub",
